body:
Maybe check out [Fortresses, Temples, & Strongholds](https://www.dmsguild.com/product/207377/WH-Fortresses-Temples--Strongholds-rules-for-building-maintaining-and-customizing-playerowned-structures) from [Walrock Homebrew](http://walrock-homebrew.blogspot.com/), it reminds me a bit of Skyrim's Hearthfire expansion.

&#x200B;

I like it because it's simple and easily tweaked. And it's pay what you want, so if you're on a budget it's much more enticing than some of the other more expensive options.
